<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Bank 6-mth net up 25 percent.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Bank 6-mth net up 25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 84.29    vs	67.26</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     35.00    vs	29.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		  664.51    vs     453.66</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  131.95    vs	97.93</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Hong Leong Bank Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
